  "en": {
   "stem": "A company uses Microsoft Dynamics 365 finance and operations apps.\nThe company plans to use Microsoft Copilot in-app help and guidance to generate responses for internal\nbusiness processes.\nYou need to add an additional knowledge source for the business processes. The solution must NOT add\nnew topics to the Copilot agent for the finance and operations apps.\nWhich knowledge source should you add?",
   "options": {
    "A": "Microsoft Dataverse",
    "B": "a public website",
    "C": "Azure AI Search",
    "D": "a file upload"
   },
   "scenario": "",
   "explanation": "Explanation:    \nTo add an additional knowledge source for internal business processes to the Microsoft Copilot in-app\nexperience for Dynamics 365 finance and operations apps—without creating new topics—you should add\nFile Uploads (such as PDF, Word, or text documents) to the \"Copilot for finance and operations apps\"\nagent in Copilot Studio.\nReference:"
  },
  "zh": {
   "stem": "一家公司使用 Microsoft Dynamics 365 财务和运营应用。\n该公司计划使用 Microsoft Copilot 应用内帮助和指导来生成内部业务流程的响应。\n您需要为业务流程添加一个额外的知识来源。解决方案必须不向财务和运营应用的 Copilot 代理添加新主\n题。\n您应该添加哪个知识来源？",
   "options": {
    "A": "Microsoft Dataverse",
    "B": "公共网站",
    "C": "Azure AI Search",
    "D": "文件上传"
   },
   "scenario": "",
   "explanation": "解释：\n要为Microsoft Copilot在Dynamics 365财务和运营应用中的应用内体验添加额外的知识来源，以支持\n内部业务流程——而无需创建新主题——您应该将文件上传（如PDF、Word或文本文件）添加到Copilot St\nudio中的“财务和运营应用的Copilot”代理中。\n参考："
  }
