  "en": {
   "stem": "A manufacturing company wants to deploy an agent that will automate supplier invoice processing.\nYou are designing a solution to evaluate the financial implications of the deployment. The company is\nespecially concerned about budget overruns.\nYou need to ensure that the solution considers the total cost of ownership (TCO), the expected savings\nfrom using automation, and whether to extend the existing AI capabilities.\nWhat should you include in the design?",
   "options": {
    "A": "a break-even analysis only",
    "B": "adopting prebuilt agents to reduce the deployment time",
    "C": "training a custom model",
    "D": "a return on AI investment (ROAI) analysis"
   },
   "scenario": "",
   "explanation": "Explanation:    \nThis design plan outlines the financial and operational framework for deploying a Microsoft-based AI agent\nfor supplier invoice processing. By leveraging current industry benchmarks and Microsoft’s own agentic AI\nframeworks, this plan focuses on maximizing Return on AI Investment (ROAI) while mitigating the risk of\nbudget overruns.\nReference:"
  },
  "zh": {
   "stem": "一家制造公司希望部署一个代理，以自动化供应商发票处理。\n您正在设计一个解决方案，以评估部署的财务影响。该公司特别关注预算超支。\n您需要确保解决方案考虑到总拥有成本（TCO）、使用自动化的预期节省，以及是否扩展现有的人工智\n能能力。\n您应该在设计中包含什么？",
   "options": {
    "A": "盈亏平衡分析仅",
    "B": "采用预构建代理以减少部署时间",
    "C": "训练自定义模型",
    "D": "人工智能投资回报率（ROAI）分析"
   },
   "scenario": "",
   "explanation": "解释：\n本设计计划概述了部署基于微软的人工智能代理用于供应商发票处理的财务和运营框架。通过利用当前行\n业基准和微软自身的代理人工智能框架，本计划专注于最大化人工智能投资回报率（ROAI），同时降低预\n算超支的风险。\n参考："
  }
