   "stem": "Which tools should you recommend to assist the CISO and the CIO with their specific responsibilities? To\nanswer, drag the appropriate tools to the correct executives. Each tool may be used once, more than\nonce, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.",
