  "type": "hotspot",
  "correctLetters": [],
  "en": {
   "stem": "A company has a Microsoft Copilot Studio prompt-and-response agent.\nYou need to ensure that the agent meets the following requirements:\nProvides effective and relevant responses\nProvides conversational outcomes\nWhich metric should you use for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate options in the\nanswer area.",
   "options": {},
   "scenario": "",
   "explanation": "Explanation:\nBox 1: Generated answers rate and quality\nProvides effective and relevant responses:\nTo ensure your Microsoft Copilot Studio agent provides effective and relevant responses, you should focus\n\non the Generated Answer Rate and Quality metrics found in the Analytics dashboard. These metrics help\nyou identify where the agent is succeeding and where knowledge gaps exist. \nKey Quality Metrics\nGenerated Answer Rate: Measures the frequency with which the agent successfully triggers a generative\nresponse from its knowledge sources.\nResponse Quality (Good vs. Poor): Copilot Studio automatically labels a sample of responses as \"Good\"\nor \"Poor\" quality based on AI assessment of relevance, completeness, and grounding.\nPoor Quality Reasons: If a response is labeled \"Poor,\" the system provides specific reasons, such as\nbeing incomplete, irrelevant, or not fully grounded.\nUnanswered Questions: Tracks queries the agent could not answer, helping you identify missing\ndocumentation or topics.\nBox 2: Satisfaction\nProvides conversational outcomes\nTo ensure your Microsoft Copilot Studio prompt-and-response agent provides optimal conversational\noutcomes, you should use the Customer Satisfaction (CSAT) metric.\nReference:"
  },
  "zh": {
   "stem": "一家公司拥有一个 Microsoft Copilot Studio 提示和响应代理。\n您需要确保该代理满足以下要求：\n提供有效且相关的响应\n提供对话结果\n您应该使用哪个指标来满足每个要求？要回答，请在\n答案区域选择适当的选项。",
   "options": {},
   "scenario": "",
   "explanation": "解释：\n框 1：生成答案的比率和质量\n提供有效且相关的响应：\n为了确保您的 Microsoft Copilot Studio 代理提供有效且相关的响应，您应该专注于\n关于分析仪表板中生成答案率和质量指标。这些指标帮助\n您识别代理成功的地方以及知识缺口所在。\n关键质量指标\n生成答案率：衡量代理成功触发其知识来源的生成\n响应的频率。\n响应质量（好与差）：Copilot Studio根据AI对相关性、完整性和基础的评估，自动将一部分响应标记为\n“好”或“差”质量。\n差质量原因：如果响应被标记为“差”，系统会提供具体原因，例如\n不完整、不相关或未完全基础。\n未回答的问题：跟踪代理无法回答的查询，帮助您识别缺失的\n文档或主题。\n框2：满意度\n提供对话结果\n为了确保您的Microsoft Copilot Studio提示和响应代理提供最佳对话\n结果，您应该使用客户满意度（CSAT）指标。\n参考："
  },
