  "type": "dragdrop",
  "correctLetters": [],
  "en": {
   "stem": "A company has a Microsoft Copilot Studio agent that has been in production for three months.\nThe agent has received positive feedback from users.\nYou need to identify the number of questions unanswered by the agent and the number of abandoned\nsessions between the users and the agent.\nWhich Copilot Studio insights should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate insights to the correct\nrequirements. Each insight may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the\nsplit bar between panes or scroll to view content.",
   "options": {},
   "scenario": "",
   "explanation": "Explanation:\nBox 1: Generated answer, rate and quality\nThe number of questions unanswered\n\nIn Microsoft Copilot Studio, you can find the number of unanswered questions by navigating to the\nAnalytics page and viewing the Generated answer rate and quality section. \n \nThis specific analytics area provides insights into how often the agent successfully generates a response\nversus when it fails to do so.\nBox 2: Conversation outcomes\nThe number of abandoned sessions between the users and the agent\nTo find the number of abandoned sessions in a Microsoft Copilot Studio agent's analytics, you can use the\nConversation outcomes chart within the Analytics dashboard. This chart specifically tracks and visualizes\nsessions with an \"Abandoned\" outcome.\nReference:"
  },
  "zh": {
   "stem": "一家公司有一个已经投入生产三个月的Microsoft Copilot Studio代理。\n该代理收到了用户的积极反馈。\n您需要确定代理未回答的问题数量以及用户与代理之间放弃的\n会话数量。\n您应该使用哪些Copilot Studio洞察？要回答这个问题，请将适当的洞察拖到正确的\n需求上。每个洞察可以使用一次、使用多次或根本不使用。您可能需要拖动\n面板之间的分隔条或滚动以查看内容。",
   "options": {},
   "scenario": "",
   "explanation": "解释：\n框1：生成的答案、比率和质量\n未回答的问题数量\n在Microsoft Copilot Studio中，您可以通过导航到\n分析页面并查看生成的答案比率和质量部分来找到未回答的问题数量。\n这个特定的分析区域提供了代理成功生成响应的频率与未能生成响应的频率的洞察。\n框2：对话结果\n用户与代理之间放弃的会话数量\n要查找Microsoft Copilot Studio代理分析中的放弃会话数量，您可以使用\n分析仪表板中的对话结果图表。该图表专门跟踪和可视化\n结果为“放弃”的会话。\n参考："
  },
